From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] glm5next: fold the DFlash drafter fc into the PP stages

VLLM_GLM5_PP_FOLD_DRAFT_FC (default 0 = unchanged). Each stage multiplies its
own aux states by its column block of the drafter fc.weight and forwards one
fp32 partial sum instead of the aux states; the last stage's drafter skips
fc and casts once to bf16. Only the fp32 summation order of fc changes. The
last stage cross-checks its block against the loaded drafter weight.

